    "为一个文件夹里的所有书设默认值。多条规则同时匹配时，路径越具体越优先；书自己的设置仍优先于规则。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set defaults for all books in a folder. When several rules match, the most specific path wins; a book’s own settings still take priority."
          }
        }
      }
    },
